  "update_count": 71,
  "description_snippet": "## Summary\n\nA heap buffer overflow write exists in PDFium's TIFF image decoder when processing a TIFF file that uses JPEG compression with a lossless JPEG codestream (SOF3) whose data precision is less than 8 bits. The bundled libtiff calculates the strip buffer size based on the TIFF BitsPerSample"
